        "quote": "(a) Except as provided in subsection (d) of this section, all competitive procurements for goods and services shall be awarded to the lowest responsible bidder in accordance with TMC 3.30.030 and rules and regulations promulgated pursuant to TMC 3.30.050 .",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.30.020:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
