          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.30.020:block:4",
          "start": 687
        },
        "quote": "(1) For goods or services where no competition exists;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.30.020:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 3.30.020 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "37d1c17c-46c0-50d0-aad0-dfb066c9c67a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 817,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.30.020:block:5",
          "start": 742
        },
        "quote": "(2) When an emergency necessitates immediate delivery of goods or services;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.30.020:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 3.30.020 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "d9170fe8-c6a0-55d9-b27a-82f1d9ade2ab",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1105,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.30.020:block:6",
          "start": 818
        },
        "quote": "(3) When a contract for goods or services is competitively procured by a public or nonprofit cooperative purchasing organization for the benefit of governmental entities. “Competitively procured” means that the procurement process meets or exceeds the City’s procurement requirements; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.30.020:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 3.30.020 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "7bb7b319-3a29-5129-bdd6-ef3507a76e8c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1298,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.30.020:block:7",
          "start": 1106
        },
        "quote": "(4) When the Director of Contracts and Procurement or designee determines that qualifications-based selection or a request for proposal is appropriate for the procurement of goods or services.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.30.020:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
